From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mikael Hug <mikaelhug@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 10:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fbcon: Draw the logo under quiet

fbcon drops the boot logo when console_loglevel is at or below
CONSOLE_LOGLEVEL_QUIET. A quiet boot is where a logo instead of text
is wanted, and nologo and fbcon=logo-count:0 already turn it off.

Remove the check, so the logo shows on a quiet boot without raising the
loglevel, which would bring back the boot text.

---
 drivers/video/fbdev/core/fbcon.c | 3 ---
 1 file changed, 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/video/fbdev/core/fbcon.c b/drivers/video/fbdev/core/fbcon.c
--- a/drivers/video/fbdev/core/fbcon.c
+++ b/drivers/video/fbdev/core/fbcon.c
@@ -1110,9 +1110,6 @@ static void fbcon_init(struct vc_data *vc, bool init)
 
 	info = fbcon_info_from_console(vc->vc_num);
 
-	if (logo_shown < 0 && console_loglevel <= CONSOLE_LOGLEVEL_QUIET)
-		logo_shown = FBCON_LOGO_DONTSHOW;
-
 	if (vc != svc || logo_shown == FBCON_LOGO_DONTSHOW ||
 	    (info->fix.type == FB_TYPE_TEXT))
 		logo = 0;
-- 
2.53.0

